flowchart LR
  subgraph Sources[Operational source systems]
    A[Payments / processor]
    B[Accounts and borrowers]
    C[Calls / dispositions / telephony]
    D[Digital / field / PTP]
    E[Campaigns / targeting / agents]
  end
  A-->R; B-->R; C-->R; D-->R; E-->R
  R[Immutable raw zone<br/>batch ID · checksum · schema version] --> S[Staging<br/>type and timestamp normalization]
  S --> Q[Quality gates and quarantine<br/>keys · nulls · conflicts · freshness]
  Q --> G[Golden entities and events<br/>validated keys · identity crosswalk]
  G --> F[Point-in-time feature layer]
  G --> M[Versioned metric registry]
  F --> M
  M --> V[CEO dashboard and alerts]
  V --> X[Decision and experiment readout]
  X --> T[Stratified randomized pilot<br/>treatment / holdout]
  T --> O[Incremental net recovery<br/>confidence interval · cost · guardrails]
  O --> V
